        <UserObject label="INSTITUTIONAL OWNERSHIP PRINCIPLE&#xa;&#xa;Institutional financial objects remain institution-owned.&#xa;OCB observes and resolves them.&#xa;Their financial consequences can be represented&#xa;in OCB&#39;s analytical ledger model." mermaidId="n:NOTE2" mermaidBaseStyle="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeWidth=1;fillColor=light-dark(#ECECFF,#1f2020);strokeColor=light-dark(#9370DB,#cccccc);fontColor=light-dark(#333333,#cccccc);fontFamily=Trebuchet MS,Verdana,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=16;" mermaidBaseValue="INSTITUTIONAL OWNERSHIP PRINCIPLE&#xa;&#xa;Institutional financial objects remain institution-owned.&#xa;OCB observes and resolves them.&#xa;Their financial consequences can be represented&#xa;in OCB&#39;s analytical ledger model." id="XsrHqBVfJDud1DoCkDES-16">
